        <mxCell id="c254" value="&lt;i&gt;The 2026 Q3 bars match because no journal entry posts to the two Furniture accounts in that quarter. The axis starts at zero. Cost of goods sold is shipments less returns, and revenue is the sales invoices before customer credits.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="438" width="860" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
